[00:00.000]...
[00:23.263]Tired of being rescued
{"厌倦了被拯救"}
[00:25.390]'cause it's just a gilded cage
{"因为这不过是镀金牢笼"}
[00:29.036]I must make amends for all
{"我必须弥补"}
[00:31.586]the mess my elders made
{"先辈们造成的混乱"}
[00:34.834]I was born to lead you all
{"我生来就要引领你们"}
[00:37.336]away from your crusade
{"远离你们的圣战"}
[00:40.560]Nations held in anguish
