[00:42.754]had me boiling with a rage
{"让我怒火中烧"}
[00:46.043]Ordinary life alluded me
{"平凡生活与我无缘"}
[00:48.889]For my duty you are losing me
{"因这份责任你正失去我"}
[00:51.738]You are one of my few weaknesses
{"你是我少有的软肋"}
[00:54.620]But this girl
{"但这个女孩"}
[00:55.549]has deep allegiances
{"怀有深沉忠诚"}
[00:58.259]In the meantime
